<section number="7.2" title="Factor Trinomials of the Form x2+bx+c">
  <learning_objectives>
    <objective number="" />
    <objective number="" />
  </learning_objectives>
  <note type="Be Prepared" number="7.4">
    <p>Before you get started, take this readiness quiz.</p>
    <p>Multiply: $$(x + 4)(x + 5).$$
If you missed this problem, review Example 6.38.</p>
  </note>
